Brave is a Chromium based web browser that blocks ads and trackers by
default.  It ships with a built-in ad blocker, HTTPS upgrading, fingerprinting
protection, a Tor enabled private window and an optional cryptocurrency
wallet.

This port builds Brave natively on FreeBSD: neither depot_tools nor gclient
are used, the sources come from the official Chromium release tarball plus
brave-core, and the browser is built with the compiler and the libraries from
the ports tree.
